# the Mac game's own moments (the Mac's unrolled loops, its own functions): nothing to call here
seven_f1_setscale   none  Learn & Play injects the scale call itself (seven_f1_scale)
seven_grid_cellrow_ctor none  the Mac's unrolled cell row constructor; Learn & Play edits the loop's count
seven_grid_wirerow_ctor none  the Mac's unrolled wire row constructor; Learn & Play edits the loop's count
seven_grid_wirerow_reset none  the Mac's unrolled wire row reset; Learn & Play edits the loop's count
seven_grid_wirerow_mark none  the Mac's unrolled wire row event; Learn & Play edits the loop's count
seven_grid_wirerow_flush none  the Mac's unrolled wire row flush; Learn & Play edits the loop's count
seven_grid_wires_dtor none  the Mac's unrolled destructor of a wire row; Learn & Play edits the loop's count
seven_s1b           none  the Mac's second standard-tuning copy; Learn & Play's one is seven_s1
